  "description": {
   "en": "It’s unclear when it began, but the inner world started invading reality. Its goal is to amplify and control the dark side of humanity in the real world, so it has parasitized eight troubled girls with exceptional beauty and traits.\n\n \n\nAs the girls gain supernatural powers, they are gradually corrupted by desire. Their target, whether by coincidence or not, is the handsome and talented Wu Se!\n\n \n\nWu Se must protect himself while surrounded by the girls’ supernatural powers and find the opportunity to fight back."
  },
